   "subject": "請教: 支援向量機迴歸(SVR: support vector machine for regression)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">各位先進，</span><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">在此有些關於SVR的問題想請教各位。\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">我最近採用e1071 package嘗試SVR，也念了相關文獻。但有些問題我一直找不到答案。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><b>1.如何判定SVR迴歸整體的表現?</b></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">我用train data跑出SVR迴歸，然後用test data預測此迴歸，那麼我們要根據什麼衡量值判斷這個SVR迴歸的表現呢? 換言之，在OLS之下，我們能用R2來判定模型整體表現，那在SVR之下，有沒有相關的衡量值呢? </span><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><b>2. 如何判定input feature的表現?</b></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">像在OLS中，我們能用迴歸係數的t值判定這些自變數的表現，那在SVR中，有沒有相關的衡量值呢? 目前有看到有文章採用e1071:: Importance()的指令，找出各變數的影響力。但總覺得結果怪怪的。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">請各位撥空指教，謝謝</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Kate</span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
