   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Kate,<div><br></div><div>參考以下內容</div><div><br></div><div>Q1: 預測模型可使用 RMSE 判斷, 值愈小愈佳, 當然也會有參數調整問題,  參考 caret 套件.</div><div><br></div><div>參考: <a href=\"https://rpubs.com/skydome20/R-Note14-SVM-SVR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rpubs.com/skydome20/R-Note14-SVM-SVR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237333778000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1r5T8tkCMRWLDeDBqvVE3s\">https://rpubs.com/skydome20/R-Note14-SVM-SVR</a></div><div><br></div><div>Q2: <br><br>此問題應該是 Feature selection 問題, 可參考 caret 套件之使用.</div><div><a href=\"https://machinelearningmastery.com/feature-selection-with-the-caret-r-package/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://machinelearningmastery.com/feature-selection-with-the-caret-r-package/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237333778000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2j56KTJJM5oJKUF5nYxQy0\">https://machinelearningmastery.com/feature-selection-with-the-caret-r-package/</a><br></div><div># end</div><div><br>Kate Peng於 2018年10月11日星期四 UTC+8上午9時26分22秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">各位先進，</span><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">在此有些關於SVR的問題想請教各位。\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">我最近採用e1071 package嘗試SVR，也念了相關文獻。但有些問題我一直找不到答案。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><b>1.如何判定SVR迴歸整體的表現?</b></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">我用train data跑出SVR迴歸，然後用test data預測此迴歸，那麼我們要根據什麼衡量值判斷這個SVR迴歸的表現呢? 換言之，在OLS之下，我們能用R2來判定模型整體表現，那在SVR之下，有沒有相關的衡量值呢? </span><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><b>2. 如何判定input feature的表現?</b></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">像在OLS中，我們能用迴歸係數的t值判定這些自變數的表現，那在SVR中，有沒有相關的衡量值呢? 目前有看到有文章採用e1071:: Importance()的指令，找出各變數的影響力。但總覺得結果怪怪的。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">請各位撥空指教，謝謝</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#2a2e2e\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Kate</span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(42,46,46);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
